WEBVTT

00:00:03.951 --> 00:00:04.617
(grunts)

00:00:04.717 --> 00:00:06.420
Hey, hey. Stoppa. Stoppa.

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:08.189
Muy risky. Lemme do it.

00:00:09.689 --> 00:00:11.392
- (muffled explosion)
- (grunts)

00:00:11.492 --> 00:00:12.560
(cheering)

00:00:12.659 --> 00:00:14.295
(grunting frantically)

00:00:14.395 --> 00:00:15.896
(belches thunderously)

00:00:15.996 --> 00:00:17.498
- (car alarms blaring)
- (people groaning)

00:00:17.597 --> 00:00:20.134
(sighs) Ciao, bellos!

00:00:21.368 --> 00:00:23.670
(laughing)

00:00:24.872 --> 00:00:26.874
There they are.
Those guys crushed my car.

00:00:26.974 --> 00:00:28.741
They destroyed the coffee shop!

00:00:28.843 --> 00:00:30.010
MAN:
Yeah, get out of here!

00:00:30.111 --> 00:00:31.579
MAN 2:
They're ruining everything.

00:00:31.678 --> 00:00:32.847
I'm sick of superheroes.

00:00:32.947 --> 00:00:34.681
- Yeah.
- Let's get 'em.

00:00:34.781 --> 00:00:37.151
- (crowd clamoring)
- (gasping, screaming)

00:00:37.251 --> 00:00:38.419
(tires squeal)

00:00:38.519 --> 00:00:40.287
Get in. (grunts)

00:00:40.387 --> 00:00:41.989
(panicked gasping, grunting)

00:00:42.089 --> 00:00:44.724
- (clamoring continues)
- (tires squealing)

00:00:44.824 --> 00:00:46.327
Gentlemen... (groans)

00:00:46.427 --> 00:00:48.728
- our experiment has failed.
- (disappointed murmuring)

00:00:48.829 --> 00:00:51.631
You are officially
going to be retired.

00:00:51.731 --> 00:00:53.601
Yeah! Retirement!

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:55.936
Uh, uh, no?

00:00:56.669 --> 00:00:58.738
(horn honks)

00:00:59.373 --> 00:01:01.741
♪

00:01:09.316 --> 00:01:10.683
(gasps)

00:01:10.783 --> 00:01:13.087
Whoa. There it is.

00:01:20.194 --> 00:01:21.395
The castle.

00:01:21.495 --> 00:01:22.830
The gargoyles. (gasps)

00:01:22.930 --> 00:01:25.232
- I can't believe I'm
really here. -(Gru sighs)

00:01:31.738 --> 00:01:33.507
RON:
(grunts) Okay.

00:01:33.607 --> 00:01:35.476
(speaking Minionese)

00:01:35.576 --> 00:01:36.911
Voilà.

00:01:37.011 --> 00:01:39.146
(sighs)
Okay, let's get this over with.

00:01:39.246 --> 00:01:41.714
- Ron, hand me my gear.
- Voilà.

00:01:41.814 --> 00:01:43.851
- Keep a close eye on him.
- RON: Okay.

00:01:43.951 --> 00:01:45.252
If you need anything,
I brought formula...

00:01:45.352 --> 00:01:47.555
- Uh-huh. Formula. Diapers.
- ...extra diapers,

00:01:47.655 --> 00:01:48.821
- his favorite Binky.
- Come on.

00:01:48.923 --> 00:01:50.790
Let's go, let's go. (grunts)

00:01:50.891 --> 00:01:52.927
(mutters mockingly)

00:01:53.027 --> 00:01:54.295
(grunts)

00:01:58.365 --> 00:02:02.036
And now we cut
through the glass with my...

00:02:02.136 --> 00:02:03.604
Diapers?

00:02:03.703 --> 00:02:04.771
What?

00:02:04.872 --> 00:02:06.273
You've got to be kidding
with me.

00:02:06.373 --> 00:02:09.043
(Minions whimpering,
speaking Minionese)

00:02:10.211 --> 00:02:11.512
Hey, guys. Guys.

00:02:11.612 --> 00:02:12.980
Guys? Guys.

00:02:13.080 --> 00:02:15.683
Guys, where is the other bag,
with my gear?

00:02:15.815 --> 00:02:17.484
Ah, in le balloon.

00:02:17.585 --> 00:02:19.386
- (Gru gasps)
- PHIL: Ah, uh...

00:02:19.486 --> 00:02:20.753
Oops. (laughs)

00:02:20.854 --> 00:02:22.656
(speaks Minionese)

00:02:22.755 --> 00:02:24.391
What? How...

00:02:24.491 --> 00:02:26.293
(grunts, groans)

00:02:26.393 --> 00:02:29.330
All right, all right.
Let's see what I got in here.

00:02:29.430 --> 00:02:30.797
Uh... come on.

00:02:30.898 --> 00:02:32.499
- Come on, come on, come on.
- (sniffs, groans)

00:02:32.600 --> 00:02:34.268
Aha.

00:02:37.204 --> 00:02:38.872
(grunts)

00:02:40.241 --> 00:02:41.976
Thank you.

00:02:43.677 --> 00:02:46.280
- (chuckles)
- Easy peasy.

00:02:46.380 --> 00:02:48.748
♪

00:02:51.518 --> 00:02:53.687
(grunting)

00:02:53.786 --> 00:02:55.189
(Gru Jr. giggling)

00:02:57.591 --> 00:02:59.159
(grunts) Huh?

00:02:59.260 --> 00:03:00.894
(both gasp)

00:03:00.995 --> 00:03:03.297
- (keys jingling)
- (grumbling quietly)

00:03:03.998 --> 00:03:06.766
(whispers):
That's Mr. Friendly.

00:03:08.435 --> 00:03:09.403
(whimpering)

00:03:09.503 --> 00:03:10.604
(grunts)

00:03:10.704 --> 00:03:12.406
No, no, no, no, no!

00:03:12.506 --> 00:03:14.908
(gasps)

00:03:16.644 --> 00:03:18.178
(gasps)

00:03:18.879 --> 00:03:20.147
(Mr. Friendly grumbling)

00:03:20.247 --> 00:03:21.382
Whew.

00:03:25.586 --> 00:03:27.655
(both grunt)

00:03:27.755 --> 00:03:29.523
- (yelps, grunts)
- (blows raspberry)

00:03:29.623 --> 00:03:31.392
Ha, ha, ha. (blows raspberry)

00:03:31.492 --> 00:03:33.793
(all panting)

00:03:36.163 --> 00:03:38.232
POPPY:
That's Dr. Destructo.

00:03:38.332 --> 00:03:39.833
He was just a kid.

00:03:39.933 --> 00:03:42.369
And there's Killer Driller's
original helmet.

00:03:42.469 --> 00:03:45.039
Come on. Stay focused.

00:03:53.781 --> 00:03:55.516
- (snaps fingers)
- Diaper.

00:03:55.616 --> 00:03:57.817
(grunting)

00:04:08.295 --> 00:04:09.363
(groans)

00:04:10.497 --> 00:04:11.999
I need something like...

00:04:12.099 --> 00:04:14.468
- something that I can...
- How about this?

00:04:14.568 --> 00:04:16.370
Nice.

00:04:17.871 --> 00:04:19.406
(lock clicks)

00:04:19.506 --> 00:04:21.175
Yes! (squeals excitedly)

00:04:24.345 --> 00:04:25.646
(gasps) We're in.

00:04:25.746 --> 00:04:26.747
GRU:
Wait.

00:04:26.847 --> 00:04:28.449
No, no, no, no, no.

00:04:28.549 --> 00:04:29.783
Baby powder.

00:04:29.917 --> 00:04:31.919
Ah, si, si. Yeah.

00:04:36.590 --> 00:04:38.025
Whoa.

00:04:38.125 --> 00:04:40.394
You know, the most important
part of a heist

00:04:40.494 --> 00:04:43.063
is being constantly aware
of potential danger.

00:04:43.163 --> 00:04:44.531
- PHIL: Le baby!
- (gasps)

00:04:44.631 --> 00:04:46.567
La la! Tiramisu!

00:04:46.667 --> 00:04:48.302
No, no! Le baby! Komay le!

00:04:48.402 --> 00:04:49.970
- No. Junior.
- (Minions gasping, whimpering)

00:04:50.070 --> 00:04:51.638
Junior, come back here.

00:04:51.739 --> 00:04:53.407
(coos)

00:04:54.108 --> 00:04:56.610
- (grunts)
- So, what's your plan now?

00:04:56.710 --> 00:04:58.746
I am dealing with it. (gasps)

00:04:58.847 --> 00:04:59.848
(giggling)

00:04:59.947 --> 00:05:01.882
(Gru groans in frustration)

00:05:01.982 --> 00:05:03.484
Don't touch anything.

00:05:03.584 --> 00:05:07.287
No. No, no, no, no, no.
No, no, no, no!

00:05:07.388 --> 00:05:08.489
(all gasp)

00:05:08.589 --> 00:05:10.391
(laughs) Good job, Junior.

00:05:10.491 --> 00:05:12.559
Way to go. (groans)

00:05:12.659 --> 00:05:14.495
(laughing)

00:05:15.562 --> 00:05:16.865
Aw, he's having fun.

00:05:16.964 --> 00:05:18.732
Eh, too much fun.

00:05:18.833 --> 00:05:20.100
(speaking Minionese)

00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:22.002
- Ah, stoppa.
- Blah, blah, blah.

00:05:22.102 --> 00:05:26.206
Please, Junior, Daddy needs
to steal a honey badger.

00:05:29.543 --> 00:05:31.145
Whew. Okay.

00:05:32.045 --> 00:05:34.648
I know they keep Lenny here
at night.

00:05:34.748 --> 00:05:36.950
And if memory serves,

00:05:37.050 --> 00:05:40.554
there is a hidden switch
around here somewhere.

00:05:40.654 --> 00:05:42.055
Ah. Aha.

00:05:42.156 --> 00:05:43.858
- (clanking)
- Yes.

00:05:43.957 --> 00:05:45.559
(creaking)

00:05:45.659 --> 00:05:46.660
(gasps)

00:05:46.760 --> 00:05:48.095
BOTH:
Ooh.

